@startuml NimBin Data Flow Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam actorStyle awesome

title NimBin Android App - Data Flow & Interactions

actor User
participant "Compose UI" as UI
participant "ViewModel" as VM
participant "Use Case" as UC
participant "Repository" as REPO
participant "API Client" as API
participant "Backend API" as BACKEND
database "Local Storage" as STORAGE

== Authentication Flow ==
User -> UI: Login (email, password)
UI -> VM: login(email, password)
VM -> UC: LoginUseCase.invoke()
UC -> REPO: AuthRepository.login()
REPO -> API: NimbinApiClient.login()
API -> BACKEND: POST /api/auth/login
BACKEND --> API: AuthResponseDto + JWT
API --> REPO: ApiResult.Success(AuthData)
REPO -> STORAGE: Save JWT token
REPO --> UC: AuthResult.Success
UC --> VM: Flow<AuthResult>
VM --> UI: Update UI state
UI --> User: Navigate to Main Screen

== Create Paste Flow ==
User -> UI: Create Paste (title, content, visibility)
UI -> VM: createPaste(request)
VM -> UC: CreatePasteUseCase.invoke()
UC -> REPO: PastesRepository.createPaste()
REPO -> STORAGE: Get JWT token
STORAGE --> REPO: JWT token
REPO -> API: NimbinApiClient.createPaste()
API -> BACKEND: POST /api/pastes + JWT
BACKEND --> API: PasteDto
API --> REPO: ApiResult.Success(PasteDto)
REPO --> UC: PastesResult.Success
UC --> VM: Flow<PastesResult>
VM --> UI: Update pastes list
UI --> User: Show success message

== Load Public Pastes Flow ==
User -> UI: Open Pastes Screen
UI -> VM: loadPastes()
VM -> UC: GetPastesUseCase.invoke()
UC -> REPO: PastesRepository.getPublicPastes()
REPO -> API: NimbinApiClient.getPublicPastes()
API -> BACKEND: GET /api/pastes/public
BACKEND --> API: List<PasteDto>
API --> REPO: ApiResult.Success(List<PasteDto>)
REPO --> UC: PastesResult.Success
UC --> VM: Flow<PastesResult>
VM --> UI: Display pastes list
UI --> User: Show pastes

== Profile Management Flow ==
User -> UI: View Profile
UI -> VM: loadProfile()
VM -> UC: GetProfileUseCase.invoke()
UC -> REPO: ProfileRepository.getMyProfile()
REPO -> STORAGE: Get JWT token
STORAGE --> REPO: JWT token
REPO -> API: NimbinApiClient.getCurrentUser()
API -> BACKEND: GET /api/users/profile + JWT
BACKEND --> API: UserDto
API --> REPO: ApiResult.Success(UserDto)
REPO --> UC: ProfileResult.Success
UC --> VM: Flow<ProfileResult>
VM --> UI: Display profile data
UI --> User: Show profile

== Error Handling Flow ==
API -> BACKEND: Any API Request
BACKEND --> API: HTTP Error (4xx/5xx)
API --> REPO: ApiResult.Error(message, code)
REPO --> UC: Result.Error
UC --> VM: Flow<Result.Error>
VM --> UI: Update error state
UI --> User: Show error message

note over UI, VM
State management через
StateFlow/SharedFlow
end note

note over REPO, API
Repository pattern изолирует
бизнес-логику от деталей API
end note

note over API, BACKEND
Автоматическая обработка JWT,
retry логика, error handling
end note

@enduml
